# Short and direct: the desire and the request, without the line about
# perceiving what is greater than the physical world. This is the form the
# Astral Campfire tape used. It is a choice, not an omission.

@segment   affirmation-direct
@title     The Gateway Affirmation — short and direct
@levels    F10
@family    affirmation
@fixed
@duration  ~1m

say Say in your mind. Say to yourself.
pause 4
say I am more than my physical body, because I am more than physical matter.
pause 6
say I deeply desire to expand. To experience. To know. To understand. To control.
pause 6
say To use such greater energies and energy systems as may be beneficial and constructive to me, and to those near and close to me.
pause 6
say I deeply desire the help and cooperation, the assistance, the understanding, of those individuals whose wisdom, development, and experience are equal or greater than my own.
pause 10
